Voice passability research tools and fine-tuned weights
Maintainer: liya243

The waveform model is based on Meta/Facebook HuBERT base (facebook/hubert-base-ls960),
whose upstream model card lists Apache License 2.0.
HuBERT: Self-Supervised Speech Representation Learning by Masked Prediction of Hidden Units.
https://huggingface.co/facebook/hubert-base-ls960
https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.07447

Dataset features were computed using SpeechBrain ECAPA-TDNN
(speechbrain/spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb), upstream Apache License 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/speechbrain/spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb
The pretrained ECAPA encoder itself is not included in this release.

Feature/rating data is separately licensed CC BY 4.0; see LICENSE_DATA.md.
